  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In the 1970s, a mission tied to Senator Abe Ribicoff and Jake Javits worked on letting Soviet Jews emigrate, and part of it took a US official to Jerusalem for a briefing by Israeli intelligence. Harald Malmgren, a former presidential adviser, tells Michels he was the one sent: \"I was sent to Jerusalem and got briefed\" by Mossad and Shin Bet, Israel's foreign intelligence and internal security services. He tells it as part of his own record of handling sensitive work at the top of government."
